# Semgrep's built-in default ignore list drops a lowercase `tests/` directory. This repo keeps its
# Monkey C unit tests there, and the deslop ruleset is meant to scan them, so this file replaces the
# default with one that does not hide them. Keep it in sync with what genuinely should not be scanned.
.git/
bin/
build/
*.iq
*.prg
*.png
*.jpg
*.svg
